  "project_description": "Commerce Combine Carts is a very simple module for Drupal Commerce 2.x which combines multiple carts so that users only ever have one.\n\n There is no configuration needed. The module works in two ways to ensure carts are always combined:\n\n \n When a cart is assigned to a user, it combines all order items into the user's main cart. \n When a user logs in, all of the user's carts are combined into one and any extra carts are deleted.",
